Annualized time-weighted return remains calculable after a complete loss.
The fund is bought for 100 USD on January 1 and is worth zero on February 1.
The 31-day total return and its annualized equivalent are both -100%.
There is no positive ending value or withdrawal, so money-weighted XIRR has
no positive investor cash flow and remains unavailable.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight investment-performance --accounts 'Assets:Fund' --from 2023-01-01 --to 2023-02-01 --format text

